{"id":"9e862027e9fc48ff","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/715_ALE.md","title":"715 ALE","display":"715_ALE","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"715-ALE\">715 ALE</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing\">\\(N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing\\)</span>。ALE 的概念构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad A=\\operatorname{name}(A),\\quad\\neg A=\\operatorname{atomneg}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad A=\\operatorname{name}(A),\\quad\\neg A=\\operatorname{atomneg}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.C=\\operatorname{exists}(R,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.C=\\operatorname{exists}(R,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atomneg}\">\\(\\operatorname{atomneg}\\)</span> 只作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{exists}\">\\(\\operatorname{exists}\\)</span> 作用于任意 ALE 概念。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.1-常元\">2.1 常元</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.2-概念名\">2.2 概念名</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.3-原子否定\">2.3 原子否定</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.4-合取\">2.4 合取</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.5-全称限制\">2.5 全称限制</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\operatorname{forall}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.6-完整存在限制\">2.6 完整存在限制</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{exists}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{exists}(R,C)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式与-TBox\">3. 包含式与 TBox</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to N_C,\\qquad\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_C:N_C\\to N_C,\\qquad\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义名字重命名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\top)=\\top,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ren}(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\top)=\\top,\\qquad\\operatorname{Ren}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{name}(\\theta_C(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\operatorname{name}(A))=\\operatorname{name}(\\theta_C(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Ren}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Ren}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Ren}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 是角色限制构造子，不绑定概念名或角色名；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\n=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}\n=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}\n=\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}\n=\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\n=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E1}\n=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}\n=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\sqcap E2}\n=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}\n=\\{A\\sqcap\\neg A\\sqsubseteq\\bot:A\\in N_C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{atomneg}}\n=\\{A\\sqcap\\neg A\\sqsubseteq\\bot:A\\in N_C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>传递：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取引入：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全称单调：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在单调：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底概念规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALE 证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 的下列六个许可条件至少一个成立（析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上述有型非空有限序列、每行满足六类许可的析取且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathcal T\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span> 是所有集合结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的类谓词，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\">\\(\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALE}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span> 如下；以下省略固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ALE}\">\\(\\mathsf{ALE}\\)</span> 标记。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\forall y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\exists y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\n\\{x\\in\\Delta:\\exists y\\in\\Delta\\ ((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALE}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\">\\(\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALE 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{exists}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{exists}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{atLeast},\\operatorname{atMost},\\operatorname{roleHierarchy}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求完整存在限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 以任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\)</span> 为填充；因此 ALE 不只是含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.\\top\">\\(\\exists R.\\top\\)</span> 的 AL。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>下列元组是元语言中的规格列表；含类谓词的分量不表示把所有集合结构收集为一个集合。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALE}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 ALE 的句法包含演算和本地语义；不含析取、任意概念否定、数目限制、角色层级或外部模型类名称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"715-ALE","text":"715 ALE","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"2.1-常元","text":"2.1 常元","level":2},{"id":"2.2-概念名","text":"2.2 概念名","level":2},{"id":"2.3-原子否定","text":"2.3 原子否定","level":2},{"id":"2.4-合取","text":"2.4 合取","level":2},{"id":"2.5-全称限制","text":"2.5 全称限制","level":2},{"id":"2.6-完整存在限制","text":"2.6 完整存在限制","level":2},{"id":"3.-包含式与-TBox","text":"3. 包含式与 TBox","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个形式系统","text":"12. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R)","display":true},{"tex":"N_C\\cap N_R=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{atomneg},\\operatorname{conj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{atomneg}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=\\operatorname{top},\\quad\\bot=\\operatorname{bottom},\\quad A=\\operatorname{name}(A),\\quad\\neg A=\\operatorname{atomneg}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"C\\sqcap D=\\operatorname{conj}(C,D),\\quad\\forall R.C=\\operatorname{forall}(R,C),\\quad\\exists R.C=\\operatorname{exists}(R,C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atomneg}","display":false},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{exists}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in N_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in N_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atomneg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}","display":false},{"tex":"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conj}(C,D)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALE}}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in N_R","display":